	<section_number>18.2-190.4</section_number>
	<catch_line>Manufacture of an unlawful electronic communication device; penalty</catch_line>
	<text>
		A person who knowingly manufactures an unlawful electronic communication device shall be guilty of a Class 6 felony.
	</text>
	<history>1993, c. 439; 1998, c. 518; 2002, c. 671; 2003, c. 354.</history>
</law>
